 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Good to hear from you. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_06",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How do people listen to podcasts at double speed? I can't understand anything.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.28,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Most people build up gradually. Try one and a quarter speed for a week, then nudge it up.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it even worth it?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.53,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "For slow talk shows, it saves a lot of time. For stories or comedy, normal speed usually works better because timing matters.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.09,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Makes sense. I mostly listen to",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 3.02,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "long interviews with scientists.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.85,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Those are perfect for a slight speed boost. Many apps also trim silences automatically, which helps without sounding rushed.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.92,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, I'll turn that on.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.15,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "podcasts.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's usually in the playback settings. You'll barely notice it.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
